  "description": "GameFrameX.Capability.Online.Persistence,GFX Online 分级持久化适配包(C249,D3=3A):Identity/PlayerStorage/资产账本/资产交易/好友关系五域一级 store 的 GameDb 适配(物化复合键唯一索引 + C247 条件写原语 + 序列接管),Session/Presence 保持易失;宿主组合根经能力服务 Override 预置,InMemory 默认不变. Graded-persistence adapter package for the GFX Online family (C249, D3=3A): GameDb adapters for the five level-one stores (identity, player storage, the asset ledger, asset transactions and friendships) built on materialized composite-key unique indexes, the C247 conditional-write primitives and sequence take-over, while sessions and presence stay volatile; composition roots pre-seed them through capability service overrides and the in-memory default is unchanged. Documentation: https://gameframex.doc.alianblank.com",
